TITL CrystalPilot n0000 in P 6/m m m
REM CrystalPilot node n0000 tool=import
CELL 0.68883 39.19000 39.19000 16.61000 90.0000 90.0000 120.0000
ZERR 24 0.00000 0.00000 0.00000 0.0000 0.0000 0.0000
LATT 1
SYMM X-Y,X,Z
SYMM Y,-X+Y,Z
SYMM -Y,X-Y,Z
SYMM -X+Y,-X,Z
SYMM X-Y,-Y,-Z
SYMM -X,-X+Y,-Z
SYMM -X,-Y,Z
SYMM Y,X,-Z
SYMM -Y,-X,-Z
SYMM -X+Y,Y,-Z
SYMM X,X-Y,-Z
SFAC C H N O
REM DISP lambda 0.68883 A is not a SHELXL built-in line (Cu/Mo/Ag K-alpha):
REM DISP f'/f'' from cctbx (sasaki: C N O; henke: H), mu = NIST attenuation in
REM DISP barn/atom
DISP $C 0.002 0.002 10.99
DISP $H 0.000 0.000 0.62
DISP $N 0.004 0.003 18.53
DISP $O 0.007 0.006 30.28
UNIT 1.0 1.0 1.0 1.0

WGHT 0.100000 0.000000
FVAR 1.00000
O     4   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000    10.04167     0.00000
N     3   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000    10.04167     0.00000
C     1   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000    10.04167     0.00000
H     2   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000    10.04167     0.00000
HKLF 4
END
